id: pm-ts-starter-sirq
title: Adopt pm CLI and SDK 2026.8.7 with extension-asset merge safety
description: "Bring the TypeScript reference extension onto the current pm CLI/SDK and pm-changelog release, install the canonical 2026.8.7 extension no-merge and managed-manifest pm-json fence, preserve exact source coverage and real npm/Bun/installed-CLI behavior, and record independent publication blockers without overstating release readiness."
